WEBVTT

00:00:05.360 --> 00:00:07.800
What? What are you doing?

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:12.530
After intensely staring at the stains on
the ceiling brings around a miracle.

00:00:12.530 --> 00:00:14.730
It looks just like Ruru's face

00:00:14.730 --> 00:00:17.640
and once it looks so, I can never
re-imagine it as anything else.

00:00:17.640 --> 00:00:20.400
Eh!! In what aspect does it look like my face?

00:00:20.420 --> 00:00:24.460
In this manner, humans hallucinate.

00:00:24.880 --> 00:00:31.820
According to Gestalt Psychology, a human brain
always perceives some meaning out of anything.

00:00:32.510 --> 00:00:34.530
It doesn't suit you at all.

00:00:34.530 --> 00:00:35.550
What's up with that?

00:00:35.550 --> 00:00:38.710
In the same way, if I conceal my eyes by wearing
sunglasses, it brings around a miracle.

00:00:38.710 --> 00:00:41.280
A cool guy in the blink of an eye.

00:00:42.280 --> 00:00:45.400
That's true. I look more beautiful after wearing a mask.

00:00:45.400 --> 00:00:50.730
Certainly. You delude yourself of the unseen
and thus think of me as a cool guy.

00:00:50.730 --> 00:00:54.710
There is a proverb consisting of the characters
"In the Dark", "Distant View", "Under a Hat".

00:00:54.710 --> 00:00:59.200
In the night when you get a glimpse of a
random woman wearing a hat from afar,

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.200
you think of her as a beautiful one.

00:01:01.280 --> 00:01:05.800
When you don't get a clear view of her,
you always expect it to be someone beautiful.

00:01:06.550 --> 00:01:10.240
As just described, a human's sense
of vision is not to be trusted.

00:01:10.240 --> 00:01:13.060
Huh!! Ruru? Where did you go?

00:01:14.500 --> 00:01:15.240
That's true.

00:01:15.240 --> 00:01:19.130
If you look from afar, you look like a cool guy.

00:01:20.040 --> 00:01:22.480
Ah, talk about yourself.

00:01:22.480 --> 00:01:25.080
You really look like a beautiful woman from afar.

00:01:25.080 --> 00:01:27.280
What was that!!!! You're the worst.

00:01:27.280 --> 00:01:28.710
Stop it!!

00:01:28.950 --> 00:01:32.460
It hurts.
Ruru: You're being rude to a lady. I won't forgive you.

00:02:00.140 --> 00:02:03.220
I can't tell what's real anymore

00:02:03.220 --> 00:02:06.140
My timeline's been ravaged by falsities

00:02:06.140 --> 00:02:07.390
What is reality?

00:02:07.390 --> 00:02:11.980
Joy and despair are just mirages flashing past

00:02:11.980 --> 00:02:15.030
Overflowing information, shaken non-fiction

00:02:15.030 --> 00:02:18.030
Red serenity, blue passion, an undecided judge

00:02:18.030 --> 00:02:19.700
Mastered by a phantom king

00:02:19.700 --> 00:02:21.280
As an impassioned queen looks on

00:02:21.280 --> 00:02:22.620
It's a crazy highway of delusions

00:02:22.620 --> 00:02:24.330
So seek your way

00:02:24.330 --> 00:02:25.580
Inside, no side

00:02:25.580 --> 00:02:27.540
It's easy to drown in illusions

00:02:27.540 --> 00:02:30.420
The sweetness is a siren's call

00:02:30.420 --> 00:02:31.670
Outside, no side

00:02:31.670 --> 00:02:34.420
If that's not enough

00:02:34.750 --> 00:02:36.210
Strip away your bonds

00:02:36.210 --> 00:02:37.760
Jump in naked

00:02:37.760 --> 00:02:39.300
Let loose your emotions

00:02:39.300 --> 00:02:42.180
See the world for what it is

00:02:42.180 --> 00:02:43.810
Yes, jump in naked

00:02:43.810 --> 00:02:48.560
What's wrong with looking for my true self?

00:02:48.560 --> 00:02:49.890
Making your world

00:02:49.890 --> 00:02:51.600
Scream without a care

00:02:51.600 --> 00:02:52.650
Changing your world
Scream without a care

00:02:52.650 --> 00:02:52.940
Changing your world

00:02:52.940 --> 00:02:54.730
We have no limits

00:02:54.730 --> 00:02:55.900
Making your world

00:02:55.900 --> 00:02:57.780
When we find our answers

00:02:57.780 --> 00:02:58.900
Changing your world
When we find our answers

00:02:58.900 --> 00:03:01.530
A new world will open

00:03:07.020 --> 00:03:10.730
Talk about a summer camp. I am so much excited.

00:03:10.730 --> 00:03:11.880
I wonder about where we are going.

00:03:12.480 --> 00:03:14.330
You're so noisy, Shousuke.

00:03:14.330 --> 00:03:17.680
Don't be like that. I am only being a bit merry, that's it.

00:03:17.880 --> 00:03:20.260
Ah! These polka dots pattern is so cute.

00:03:20.260 --> 00:03:23.000
Yes. It's popular this summer.

00:03:23.000 --> 00:03:25.910
My friends from elementary school are also into this.

00:03:26.020 --> 00:03:29.150
I see. The polka dots are a fad this year.

00:03:29.910 --> 00:03:32.200
Exciting, isn't it? Mai-oneesama.

00:03:32.200 --> 00:03:33.710
Yes, it is.

00:03:33.800 --> 00:03:36.710
Staying at a lodging beside the sea is just wonderful.

00:03:36.710 --> 00:03:39.620
We've been busy these days
exterminating phantoms and all.

00:03:39.620 --> 00:03:41.620
I want to at least enjoy our summer vacation.

00:03:41.620 --> 00:03:42.950
Wait! Koito!

00:03:42.950 --> 00:03:45.400
You've been stuffing candies the whole time.

00:03:46.220 --> 00:03:46.910
Do you want one?

00:03:47.020 --> 00:03:49.480
No. I had no intention like that.

00:03:51.930 --> 00:03:52.910
Thank you.

00:03:53.950 --> 00:03:55.020
I am depressed.

00:03:55.020 --> 00:03:57.260
Whoa! What an awful face!!

00:03:57.370 --> 00:03:59.420
I hate summer.

00:03:59.710 --> 00:04:03.550
Why do we have to be out in this heat to begin with?

00:04:03.660 --> 00:04:06.510
I really wanted to read books in my room.

00:04:06.730 --> 00:04:10.000
Don't say something that disappointing.

00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:11.640
You still call yourself a high school boy.

00:04:11.640 --> 00:04:14.280
That's right, Haruhiko.

00:04:14.280 --> 00:04:16.060
Think for a sec.

00:04:16.060 --> 00:04:18.460
What comes with summer, the sea and the sun and...??

00:04:18.640 --> 00:04:19.640
Shell gathering.

00:04:19.640 --> 00:04:20.530
That's not it.

00:04:22.950 --> 00:04:25.170
Hey. What kind of swimsuit did you bring?

00:04:25.260 --> 00:04:26.620
I..

00:04:26.620 --> 00:04:28.130
Swimsuits!!!

00:04:28.200 --> 00:04:30.550
Finally realized, fool.

00:04:30.910 --> 00:04:33.550
It's our summer, Haruhiko.

00:04:33.680 --> 00:04:37.200
This time, I am using one which is made of less fabric.

00:04:37.200 --> 00:04:39.350
That is so environment friendly.

00:04:39.640 --> 00:04:42.220
Mai-oneesama, what kind of swimsuit
will you be wearing?

00:04:42.280 --> 00:04:44.750
I had a hard time finding one for my size.

00:04:44.750 --> 00:04:46.880
Well, I brought a normal bikini.

00:04:47.040 --> 00:04:47.660
Bi..!!

00:04:47.820 --> 00:04:51.680
I too wore a bold one.

00:04:51.820 --> 00:04:53.680
I see. Good for you.

00:04:53.680 --> 00:04:55.680
Eh!! You're such a jerk!

00:04:55.680 --> 00:04:57.200
What's up with your attitude?

00:04:57.200 --> 00:04:59.280
You're being impolite to a lady here.

00:04:59.530 --> 00:05:00.770
Good lord!

00:05:01.080 --> 00:05:02.150
Sea..

00:05:02.550 --> 00:05:04.150
..is the best!!

00:05:07.970 --> 00:05:11.930
Wow!! This is such an elegant place.

00:05:13.060 --> 00:05:14.280
We're coming in.

00:05:14.530 --> 00:05:17.060
How odd! It's so silent in here.

00:05:17.060 --> 00:05:17.910
You're right.

00:05:18.460 --> 00:05:19.640
There's nobody here.

00:05:19.840 --> 00:05:20.680
Yes.

00:05:21.400 --> 00:05:23.550
I get it that it's so much spacious.

00:05:23.550 --> 00:05:25.660
But it's kind of deserted.

00:05:26.330 --> 00:05:29.000
It's like a ghost will bump out in no time.

00:05:29.400 --> 00:05:31.440
I am a bit scared.

00:05:31.680 --> 00:05:34.110
Oh! Thank you for coming here.

00:05:34.620 --> 00:05:37.570
Apologies for not being able to greet you.

00:05:37.660 --> 00:05:38.710
Ah!! No.

00:05:39.280 --> 00:05:41.530
We are suffering from labour shortage.

00:05:44.130 --> 00:05:50.480
I have something to express formally
regarding this summer camp.

00:05:51.220 --> 00:05:54.420
There's a reason we chose this specific lodging house.

00:05:57.350 --> 00:05:58.530
If you'd please.

00:05:58.660 --> 00:05:59.220
Yes.

00:05:59.840 --> 00:06:04.640
Every summer, many customers arrive for a swim here.

00:06:04.860 --> 00:06:09.460
This causes our lodging to have the
most lively atmosphere each year.

00:06:10.510 --> 00:06:13.260
But starting this summer....

00:06:20.370 --> 00:06:22.420
Did a phantom appear?

00:06:22.620 --> 00:06:23.420
Yes.

00:06:23.510 --> 00:06:28.240
Since the appearance of that phantom,
weird things started happening.

00:06:28.640 --> 00:06:33.600
The rumours started to spread eventually
and people stopped coming here.

00:06:34.080 --> 00:06:36.820
That was the reason why it felt so deserted.

00:06:36.930 --> 00:06:39.460
Uhm.. what were the weird things that occurred?

00:06:39.460 --> 00:06:43.800
That!! I cannot possibly say it.

00:06:45.400 --> 00:06:48.020
I have no other choice but to request everybody here.

00:06:48.020 --> 00:06:50.020
Please help me with this matter.

00:06:50.600 --> 00:06:54.220
Whoa!! That was some serious development.

00:06:54.310 --> 00:06:57.800
It was so dreadful that she couldn't even say it.

00:06:57.800 --> 00:07:01.480
It seems she had problems from the very start.

00:07:02.130 --> 00:07:04.440
Wait! Why is Ruru in the boys room in the first place?

00:07:04.550 --> 00:07:09.860
You say all that but aren't you actually
happy to have a woman here?

00:07:09.860 --> 00:07:11.020
Come come.

00:07:11.020 --> 00:07:13.570
Huh!! I have no interest in a small child like you.

00:07:13.570 --> 00:07:15.750
Whoa!! What's with your way of talking!

00:07:15.750 --> 00:07:17.640
That's why you aren't popular.

00:07:17.640 --> 00:07:19.150
Did you say something?

00:07:19.350 --> 00:07:21.280
I won't apologise for it.

00:07:21.570 --> 00:07:23.930
I thought it was a vacation this whole time

00:07:24.400 --> 00:07:26.170
and now we've to exterminate phantoms.

00:07:26.170 --> 00:07:29.240
This is such a disappointment for
a long-awaited summer vacation.

00:07:29.420 --> 00:07:30.480
But on the other hand..

00:07:30.600 --> 00:07:36.370
As gratitude for expelling the phantom,
the lodging and food will all be for free

00:07:36.370 --> 00:07:38.930
"All-you-can-eat" fresh fish too.

00:07:39.130 --> 00:07:40.800
All-you-can-eat!

00:07:40.880 --> 00:07:43.260
"All-you-can-eat" handmade sweets too.

00:07:43.570 --> 00:07:45.420
Handmade Sweets!!!

00:07:45.860 --> 00:07:48.220
A bear-san is also waiting near the hot spring.

00:07:48.800 --> 00:07:50.220
Bear-san!!

00:07:50.220 --> 00:07:53.000
There's a hot spring!! Wonderful!

00:07:53.000 --> 00:07:55.000
Let's all go together afterwards.

00:07:56.510 --> 00:07:57.660
Hot springs!

00:07:57.660 --> 00:07:58.840
"All-you-can-eat"!!

00:07:58.840 --> 00:07:59.840
Sweets!

00:07:59.840 --> 00:08:00.680
Bear-san!!

00:08:00.840 --> 00:08:04.910
In that case, let us all beat that phantom
quickly and enjoy this camp.

00:08:04.910 --> 00:08:06.400
It's all free anyway.

00:08:06.550 --> 00:08:08.970
Let us restore peace in this summer beach.

00:08:09.040 --> 00:08:12.860
We won't let something like phantoms interrupt our camp.

00:08:12.910 --> 00:08:14.220
Well said.

00:08:14.570 --> 00:08:15.460
Hey Haruhiko.

00:08:15.550 --> 00:08:18.970
While we go shopping, let's also perform
a preliminary inspection of the beach.

00:08:24.460 --> 00:08:26.400
This beach is peace itself.

00:08:26.400 --> 00:08:29.260
It doesn't even remotely look like a phantom will appear here.

00:08:29.460 --> 00:08:32.200
Hey phantom! Come out!

00:08:32.200 --> 00:08:33.080
Stop that.

00:08:33.530 --> 00:08:34.440
Haruhiko.

00:08:35.660 --> 00:08:37.750
Were you two out shopping?

00:08:37.860 --> 00:08:38.510
Yes.

00:08:38.730 --> 00:08:40.510
Simultaneously scouting for the phantom too.

00:08:40.510 --> 00:08:42.440
Phantom, phantom..

00:08:42.440 --> 00:08:44.110
But peace itself rests here..

00:08:44.110 --> 00:08:45.800
That's true.

00:08:45.800 --> 00:08:49.150
Could it've escaped because of us?

00:08:49.420 --> 00:08:54.370
It can also be that it went off somewhere
since people stopped coming here.

00:08:54.860 --> 00:08:56.480
Was it lonely by itself?

00:08:59.220 --> 00:09:00.280
Senpai..

00:09:00.820 --> 00:09:02.530
Alright, Haruhiko.

00:09:02.800 --> 00:09:04.530
It looks like the phantom isn't here anymore.

00:09:04.660 --> 00:09:06.860
Let's have fun together freely.

00:09:06.970 --> 00:09:09.680
That's true. It's almost evening today.

00:09:09.680 --> 00:09:12.330
Let's enjoy it wholeheartedly from tomorrow.

00:09:15.110 --> 00:09:15.840
Yes.

00:09:16.310 --> 00:09:18.640
Then, how about playing games together with everyone?

00:09:18.640 --> 00:09:20.280
Let's compete in table tennis.

00:09:20.440 --> 00:09:22.080
No. I want to rest in my room.

00:09:22.080 --> 00:09:24.130
Let's meet together after a bath in the hot springs.

00:09:24.130 --> 00:09:25.400
Sounds good.

00:10:24.080 --> 00:10:27.440
I can't eat anymore.

00:10:38.200 --> 00:10:38.970
Haruhiko.

00:10:40.200 --> 00:10:41.130
Senpai?

00:10:42.550 --> 00:10:43.860
Did something happen?

00:10:43.930 --> 00:10:45.860
I wasn't able to sleep.

00:10:46.000 --> 00:10:46.930
Me too.

00:10:46.930 --> 00:10:48.930
Shousuke was snoring too much.

00:10:50.130 --> 00:10:53.040
I am used to sleep alone so I couldn't settle down.

00:10:53.530 --> 00:10:54.440
Me too.

00:10:55.200 --> 00:10:58.480
I am living alone for such a long time
that it became a norm for me.

00:10:58.480 --> 00:11:00.710
I didn't quite felt lonely.

00:11:01.310 --> 00:11:04.800
Rather I thought it was good being alone.

00:11:06.020 --> 00:11:08.510
Fun times, hard times.

00:11:08.660 --> 00:11:11.060
I experienced so many different things.

00:11:11.950 --> 00:11:16.350
It's not that bad having friends.

00:11:17.080 --> 00:11:18.310
That was what I thought.

00:11:19.420 --> 00:11:21.280
<i>"Was it lonely by itself?"</i>

00:11:30.350 --> 00:11:31.750
Senpai..

00:11:31.970 --> 00:11:33.200
What are you guys doing?

00:11:33.200 --> 00:11:35.200
Kiss?? Were you two going to kiss?

00:11:35.200 --> 00:11:36.530
What the hell are you saying!!

00:11:36.530 --> 00:11:38.750
There was no such mood for it.

00:11:38.750 --> 00:11:40.820
That's true, right? That's true.

00:11:41.000 --> 00:11:42.820
What! That's boring.

00:11:43.820 --> 00:11:44.880
Mai-oneesama?

00:11:45.200 --> 00:11:46.170
Eh?

00:11:46.530 --> 00:11:47.620
What are you guys doing here?

00:11:47.620 --> 00:11:48.550
Everyone?

00:11:48.950 --> 00:11:52.000
When I woke up, you weren't there.

00:11:52.150 --> 00:11:54.350
Sorry. The night sky is so beautiful, that's why...

00:11:54.680 --> 00:11:56.550
Ah!! It's true.

00:11:56.550 --> 00:11:57.710
Is it the Milky Way?

00:11:57.710 --> 00:11:59.260
The moon is so beautiful too.

00:11:59.260 --> 00:12:01.150
I thought of this happening.

00:12:01.750 --> 00:12:03.150
Dango?

00:12:03.640 --> 00:12:05.510
They are Otsukimi Dango.

00:12:05.510 --> 00:12:08.110
Jeez. Where did you get that from?

00:12:08.260 --> 00:12:09.800
Is it alright to eat them?

00:12:09.800 --> 00:12:11.240
Me too.

00:12:11.240 --> 00:12:12.600
I will have some.

00:12:13.510 --> 00:12:14.840
They are delicious.

00:12:14.840 --> 00:12:17.350
Hey Haruhiko, your portion will be gone too.

00:12:17.350 --> 00:12:18.280
Yes Yes.

00:12:18.280 --> 00:12:19.950
This is so much elegant.

00:12:19.950 --> 00:12:21.150
I will have one more.

00:12:32.020 --> 00:12:33.530
Now, let's swim.

00:12:33.530 --> 00:12:35.400
This is a bit embarassing.

00:12:40.130 --> 00:12:41.280
It's the sea.

00:12:41.350 --> 00:12:43.420
Will the headphones be alright?

00:12:43.570 --> 00:12:44.530
It's waterproof.

00:12:44.530 --> 00:12:46.130
Wow! It's so spacious.

00:12:46.130 --> 00:12:47.620
The sea is so lovely.

00:12:47.620 --> 00:12:48.970
Isn't it?

00:12:50.600 --> 00:12:51.550
It's summer.

00:12:52.220 --> 00:12:55.550
Finally our summer has come.

00:13:05.640 --> 00:13:07.570
What! A phantom!!

00:13:07.570 --> 00:13:08.170
It's huge!!

00:13:15.530 --> 00:13:17.130
Wait!! What the heck is this!!

00:13:18.950 --> 00:13:19.660
Shit!!

00:13:20.260 --> 00:13:21.660
Are you guys alright?

00:13:23.350 --> 00:13:24.280
I am sorry.

00:13:25.950 --> 00:13:26.660
Eh!!

00:13:28.240 --> 00:13:28.730
Huh!!

00:13:29.530 --> 00:13:31.930
EHHHHHHHHH!!!!!!!!

00:13:42.200 --> 00:13:42.910
eh!!

00:13:42.910 --> 00:13:45.620
Wait!! What is going on?

00:13:45.620 --> 00:13:47.280
What in the hell is happening?

00:13:47.480 --> 00:13:49.170
Ahh! Haruhiko.

00:13:49.170 --> 00:13:51.770
If you even glimpse this side for a sec, I will beat you up.

00:13:51.770 --> 00:13:52.910
I am not looking.

00:13:52.910 --> 00:13:53.820
Are you alright?

00:13:55.040 --> 00:13:58.060
Astounding amount of fog spread out all of a sudden.

00:14:02.170 --> 00:14:03.910
So this was it?

00:14:04.040 --> 00:14:05.060
Yes.

00:14:05.060 --> 00:14:07.530
I finally understand what you previously said.

00:14:08.110 --> 00:14:14.200
A sea monster phantom arriving at the beach and taking
pleasure by creating weird illusions on humans.

00:14:14.550 --> 00:14:18.330
It's like a criminal who takes delight in people's reaction to his crimes.

00:14:18.420 --> 00:14:21.260
Everything looks like polka dots.

00:14:21.420 --> 00:14:23.910
Something so awful is happening.

00:14:24.130 --> 00:14:27.770
If you knew everything will look like polka dots, then
why did you wear a bikini in the first place?

00:14:28.000 --> 00:14:30.530
That.. is because it's summer.

00:14:30.770 --> 00:14:31.710
Yes?

00:14:31.970 --> 00:14:34.570
It's not like we're actually naked.

00:14:34.570 --> 00:14:36.480
I still can't calm down.

00:14:36.480 --> 00:14:38.480
This is the first time in my life such a thing is happening.

00:14:38.550 --> 00:14:41.130
Wow!! Everybody looks like they're naked.

00:14:41.130 --> 00:14:42.680
It's so amusing.

00:14:42.680 --> 00:14:43.530
You guys look like that too.

00:14:44.110 --> 00:14:46.710
Jeez! We can't fight like this.

00:14:47.040 --> 00:14:50.200
Haruhiko, think of something to break this deadlock.

00:14:50.200 --> 00:14:51.350
Yes, yes.

00:14:51.910 --> 00:14:56.310
It's said that a sea monster is actually
the manifestation of a mirage itself.

00:14:56.770 --> 00:15:00.020
This polka dot phenomenon is likely
occurring when light is refracting

00:15:00.020 --> 00:15:03.020
due to temperature change in
the surrounding atmosphere.

00:15:03.640 --> 00:15:10.440
Furthermore, the terrifying part of this is that it
makes the hidden parts of our bodies look naked.

00:15:11.170 --> 00:15:13.570
Please don't look this way.

00:15:13.570 --> 00:15:14.280
Pervert!

00:15:14.570 --> 00:15:18.680
That aside, you guys look naked too.
Don't come this way.

00:15:18.930 --> 00:15:23.060
In a beach like this with no shelter,
you can't help but look.

00:15:23.240 --> 00:15:26.130
Ah!! That Ero-phantom!!

00:15:26.440 --> 00:15:27.400
Reina..

00:15:28.220 --> 00:15:29.770
I will suck it up.

